text":"運動員承受失敗的經驗比一般學生多","n":16,"ssz":"...........2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失敗不只代表結束，也可能帶來成長","n":16,"ssz":"...............1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比賽勝負通常取決於運動員的心理素質","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要練習夠久夠認真，一定能獲得勝利","n":17,"ssz":"..........1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列何者最符合文章主旨？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"運動比賽中，臨場發揮比平時努力重要","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對強大的對手時，應該避免正面競爭","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失敗可以有不同意義，換個角度能繼續前進","n":19,"ssz":"...........1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有得到獎牌的選手，也應該受到大家肯定","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果你和家人吵架、溝通失敗，根據本課主旨，你可以怎麼做？","n":28,"ssz":"...1........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這次談話失敗，代表家人永遠不會理解我","n":18,"ssz":".............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要假裝沒事，就不需要再面對這個問題","n":18,"ssz":"...............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可以回想卡住原因，調整說法，再找機會溝通","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"應該堅持自己沒錯，等家人消氣後來找我道歉","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（四☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"柔道選手楊勇緯曾在雅加達亞運的八強賽落敗，而緊接","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每一個人都會經歷挫折和失敗，而面對失敗時的「想法」，往往會決定我們能否找到下一步。面對失敗時，會有情緒很正常，但更重要的是，誘發我們情緒的「想法」是什麼？分辨哪些是已經「發生的事」，哪些是心裡的「想法」，並判斷：哪一種想法會讓自己停在原地，哪一種想法能幫助自己找到下一步。失敗不一定代表結束。當我們學會換一種方式理解失敗，就有機會把失落變成提醒，把挫折變成繼續前進的力量。","n":186,"ssz":"..1.......1...........................1....................................................................2.............2...........1.....1............2................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎從小齊的故事出發：先從小齊的故事來看看他可能的感受與想法，並進一步幫助他找出適合的下一步。","n":46,"ssz":"................................1..........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.覺察感受","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊被三振後，球隊輸了，你覺得此時他可能有哪些感受？請勾選。（可複選）","n":35,"ssz":"..............1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"難過","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自責","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不甘心","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"害怕被責怪","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想逃避","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].reflection","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→失敗後有情緒是正常的。真正重要的不是「不能難過」，而是察覺自己難過之後，怎麼理解這件事，而且，想法會影響情緒。","n":56,"ssz":".................1......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.感受背後的事實與想法","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據小齊的故事，哪些是事實？哪些是想法？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊在最後一球揮空，被三振","n":13,"ssz":".....2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"事實","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想法","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"球隊最後輸掉比賽","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊一定不適合打棒球","n":10,"ssz":"..1.1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊這段時間的努力都白費了","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊應該要加強判斷球路","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"同樣是「被三振」，下面哪一句比較像事實？","n":20,"ssz":"............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊很沒用，害大家輸球","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊在關鍵時刻被三振","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊以後都不該再上場","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊的努力全部都白費了","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].reflection","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→事實是已經發生的事；想法是我們對事情的解釋。失敗讓人痛苦，常常是因為我們腦中出現的想法。","n":45,"ssz":"..................................1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.看見想法的影響","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請閱讀小齊可能出現的四種想法，選出「最能幫助他繼續前進」的一句。","n":32,"ssz":".............................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是我害大家輸球，我真的很沒用。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我不適合打棒球，以後不要再上場。","n":16,"ssz":".1........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我很難過，但這次提醒我要多練判斷球路。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"反正只是運氣不好，不用再想這件事。","n":17,"ssz":".........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼上題的答案比較有幫助？請勾選兩個原因。","n":22,"ssz":"1.................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它承認小齊會難過。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它把責任全部推給別人。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它指出可以練習的方向。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它假裝失敗完全不重要。","n":11,"ssz":".......1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它沒有否定小齊整個人。","n":11,"ssz":"........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它認為小齊無法控制成敗。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].reflection","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→有些想法會讓我們卡住；有些想法會讓我們看見下一步。成長是從失敗中找出可以調整的地方。","n":43,"ssz":".......................1...1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.提出行動方案","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請練習將下面的想法改寫成比較有行動力的說法。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].example.原本想法","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我數學就是不好，再讀也沒有用。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].example.改寫","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我不是數學不好，而是需要更多有效的練習方法。","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小齊可能的想法──「我不適合打棒球。」","n":19,"ssz":"....